PANY'S 153RD CONSECUTIVE QUARTERLY DIVIDEND. ATMOS ENERGY CORPORATION, AN S&P 500 COMPANY HEADQUARTERED IN DALLAS, IS THE COUNTRY'S LARGEST NATURAL GAS-ONLY DISTR"}{'symbol': 'AXON', 'date': '2022-02-08 04:00:00', 'title': 'AXON ANNOUNCES NEW EUROPEAN R&D OFFICE IN LONDON', 'text': "LONDON AND SEATTLE, FEB. 8, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- AXON (NASDAQ: AXON), THE GLOBAL LEADER IN CONNECTED PUBLIC SAFETY TECHNOLOGIES, TODAY ANNOUNCED IT WILL CONTINUE ITS GLOBAL EXPANSION BY OPENING ITS FIRST EUROPEAN RESEARCH AND DEVELOPMENT (R&D) OFFICE IN LONDON. AXON HAS APPOINTED RAN MOKADY AS SITE LEAD AND WILL LOOK TO HIRE WORLD-CLASS ENGINEERS, PRODUCT MANAGERS AND RELATED ROLES OVER THE COMING MONTHS TO FURTHER AXON'S MISSION TO PROTECT LIFE AND GLOBALLY DELIVER DISRUPTIVE TECHNOLOGIES TO PUBLIC SAFETY."}{'symbol': 'BDX', 'date': '2022-02-08 06:50:00', 'title': 'BD COLLABORATES WITH RETURNSAFE TO HELP EMPLOYERS MANAGE COVID-19 TESTING', 'text': 'FRANKLIN LAKES, N.J., FEB. 8, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0BD (BECTON, DICKINSON AND COMPANY) (NYSE: BDX), A LEADING GLOBAL MEDICAL TECHNOLOGY COMPANY, TODAY ANNOUNCED\xa0A COLLABORATION WITH RETURNSAFE, THE ALL-IN-ONE SOFTWARE SOLUTION FOR COVID-19 EMPLOYEE HEALTH, SAFETY AND COMPLIANCE, TO INTEGRATE THE\xa0BD VERITOR™ AT-HOME COVID-19 TEST\xa0DIRECTLY WITHIN THE RETURNSAFE TESTING MANAGEMENT PLATFORM.'}{'symbol': 'BRK-B', 'date': '2022-02-08 14:22:00', 'title': 'HELZBERG DIAMONDS AND BRITISH DESIGNER JENNY PACKHAM CREATE NEW HONEYBEE-INSPIRED BRIDAL JEWELRY COLLECTION', 'text': "KANSAS CITY, MO., FEB. 8, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0HELZBERG DIAMONDS, ONE OF THE JEWELRY INDUSTRY'S MOST INNOVATIVE RETAILERS, RECENTLY EXPANDED ITS PRESTIGIOUS PARTNERSHIP WITH BRITISH EVENINGWEAR AND BRIDAL DESIGNER JENNY PACKHAM."}{'symbol': 'BIIB', 'date': '2022-02-08 19:09:00', 'title': '(BIIB) NEWS: DID YOU SUFFER A SUBSTANTIAL LOSS? CONTACT JOHNSON FISTEL ABOUT LEADING BIOGEN INC. CLASS ACTION LAWSUIT', 'text': 'SAN DIEGO, CALIFORNIA--(NEWSFILE CORP. - FEBRUARY 8, 