ION OF A PROGRAM DESIGNED TO PROVIDE LOCAL MARKET ASSISTANCE TO BUILDERS WHO ARE FACING A VARIETY OF CHALLENGES IN THE GROWING ECONOMY.'}{'symbol': 'WTW', 'date': '2022-02-08 06:00:00', 'title': 'WTW REPORTS FOURTH QUARTER AND FULL YEAR 2021 EARNINGS(1)', 'text': 'ARLINGTON, VA. AND LONDON, FEB. 08, 2022 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- WTW (NASDAQ: WTW) (THE “COMPANY”), A LEADING GLOBAL ADVISORY, BROKING AND SOLUTIONS COMPANY, TODAY ANNOUNCED FINANCIAL RESULTS FOR THE FOURTH QUARTER AND FULL YEAR ENDED DECEMBER\xa031, 2021.'}{'symbol': 'ZTS', 'date': '2022-02-08 16:12:00', 'title': 'ZOETIS DECLARES SECOND QUARTER 2022 DIVIDEND', 'text': 'PARSIPPANY, N.J.--(BUSINESS WIRE)---- $ZTS #DIVIDEND--ZOETIS HAS DECLARED A DIVIDEND OF $0.325 PER SHARE FOR THE SECOND QUARTER OF 2022.'}